echnology?</i></li> <li><strong><i>Don&rsquo;t</i></strong><i> you think avoiding ambiguity helps the negotiation process?</i></li> </ul> <p>These are not real questions, but they are asking the listener to agree with what they state.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Shouldn't CEOs always hire experts to deal with this kind of negotiations?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Aren't the estimates of the performance of a technology product promised at the first stage of the negotiations?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Simple Present Passive Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>When we want to give importance to the <i>Object</i> of a sentence or when the <i>Subject</i> is not important or unknown, the <strong><i>Passive Voice</i></strong> is used.</p>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p><strong><i>Passive Voice</i></strong> is used in the <i>Simple </i>to talk about situations that occur on a regular basis and its doer is unknown or is not important.</p> <p>To make the simple present passive in, the <strong><i>to be</i></strong> verb is used in the <i>present simple</i> as the auxiliary at the beginning of the question followed by the object, and then the main verb in its <i>Past Participle Form</i>.</p>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To be verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Object\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Main verb (Past Participle)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Complement+ ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the training schedule\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"included\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the contract?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are technology negotiations understood differently from other types of negotiation?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Aren't the estimates of the performance of a technology product promised at the first stage of the negotiations?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "have a word"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to speak with someone to talk about a specific topic"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Professor, can I have a word with you?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "stuck"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unable to advance"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's just that I'm stuck on an essay I'm writing about technology negotiation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ambit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the range or context of a specific area of interest"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Nowadays, executives are facing negotiations in an ambit that most people know very little about."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hurdle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an obstacle"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Therefore, it is necessary for negotiators to try to foresee any possible hurdles in the implementation to avoid all these pitfalls."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n7le01ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "misunderstanding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a disagreement; a comprehension mistake due to a failure in